# Route: guide 39 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Undead
# (1199 of 1215 eligible quests, 157.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 57 to
# 58, 59 quests, 3.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (The Barrens, Dustwallow Marsh, Thousand Needles, Un'Goro Crater,
# Stonetalon Mountains): Ratchet -> The Mor'shan Rampart -> The Crossroads ->
# Ratchet -> Camp Taurajo -> The Crossroads -> Camp Taurajo -> The Merchant
# Coast -> The Quagmire -> The Den of Flame -> The Quagmire -> The Shimmering
# Flats -> Lakkari Tar Pits -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Star, the Hand and the Heart
# (736; Grel'borg the Miser 39, Dagun the Ravenous 43, Mogh the Undying 44);
# Earthen Arise (6481; Goggeroc 20).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Willix the Importer (1144), Blueleaf Tubers (1221),
# Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Deviate Eradication (1487), Deviate Eradication
# (1487), The Glowing Shard (6981), Tiara of the Deep (2846), Gahz'rilla
# (2770).

